<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz-W Q2 net up to PLN 0.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz-W Q2 net up to PLN 0.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
